  "description": "Standalone observability primitives for the MAIT platform: CorrelationId middleware, DelegatingHandler propagation, structured JSON console logging, opt-in OpenTelemetry distributed tracing (OTLP) and a service-login DelegatingHandler (LoginDeServicioHandler) that replaces long-lived static JWTs. Independent of MAIT.Services and MAIT.Api so it can be consumed by services on any MAIT.* version.",
